{"chunk_id":"CH-ACA-A01-DOC-A01-ACADEMIC-POLICY-0003","chunk_index":3,"chunk_version":"V1-b13114573754","chunk_type":"POLICY","chunk_text":"2.5.4 TATA TERTIB PERKULIAHAN\nPelaksanaan perkuliahan secara reguler diatur dalam tata tertib yang wajib ditaati oleh seluruh\nMahasiswa. Tata tertib selama pelaksanaan kegiatan perkuliahan diatur sebagai berikut:\n\n1. Mahasiswa diwajibkan hadir sekurang-kurangnya 10 menit sebelum jam perkuliahan dimulai.\n\n2. Mahasiswa tidak diperkenankan makan di ruang kuliah.\n\n3. Mahasiswa tidak diperkenankan menimbulkan gangguan selama kuliah berlangsung.\n\n4. Selama perkuliahan berlangsung mahasiswa tidak diperkenankan meninggalkan ruang kuliah,\nkecuali dengan seizin dosen.","token_count":564,"character_count":564,"document_id":"DOC-A01-ACADEMIC","clean_document_id":"CLN-A01-ACADEMIC-001","supporting_clean_document_ids":"NOT_APPLICABLE","source_id":"A01","title":"Buku Panduan Universitas 2025/2026 — Bagian Akademik","section_title":"Tata Tertib Perkuliahan dan UTS/UAS","subsection_title":"2.5.4 TATA TERTIB PERKULIAHAN","heading_path":"Buku Panduan Universitas 2025/2026 — Bagian Akademik > Tata Tertib Perkuliahan dan UTS/UAS > 2.5.4 TATA TERTIB PERKULIAHAN","table_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","row_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","event_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","procedure_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","page_start":23,"page_end":24,"source_page":23,"anchor":"NOT_APPLICABLE","locator_text":"<!-- locator: source_id=A01; raw_filename=A01__panduan-universitas__2025-2026__verif1__2026-07-24.pdf; locator_type=PDF_PAGE; pdf_page_start=23; pdf_page_end=24; printed_page_start=15; printed_page_end=16; section=2.5.4-2.5.5 -->","raw_record_ids":"REC-0001","official_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cd8S6GOpP47KIPuON125OaHKdOxZEzHa/view?usp=sharing","publisher_unit":"Universitas AMIKOM Yogyakarta / DAAK","academic_year":"2025/2026","semester":"NOT_APPLICABLE","cohort":"2025","agent_namespace":"academic","mapped_agent_namespaces":"academic","retrieval_namespace":"active_academ